{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "27", "m": "07", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "16", "M": "05", "S": "39"}}, "news": [{"title": "Mumbai: Pattathu Brothers' directors booked for failing to hand over amenities to housing society", "para": "According to a complaint lodged by an SRA assistant engineer, Joseph S Pattathu and Pearl Joseph Pattathu, directors of Pattathu Brothers, allegedly breached redevelopment terms by failing to transfer possession of six required facilities to the eligible beneficiaries after securing completion certificates for the project.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/mumbai-realty-firm-directors-charged-for-withholding-amenities-from-housing-society/132665807?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-651756/132665807.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Retailers lease 4.1 million sq ft Grade-A mall space in H1 2026: Report", "para": "India\u2019s top seven cities recorded gross leasing of 4.1 million sq ft of Grade-A mall space in H1 2026, against new completions of 0.9 million sq ft, according to Anarock. Grade-A mall vacancy declined to 6.7%, the lowest level since 2010.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/retail/retail-leasing-surges-to-41-million-sq-ft-in-indias-top-cities-amid-supply-shortage/132654430?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-1766782/132654430.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "retail"}, {"title": "Indore: IMC issues fire safety directives to building owners, commercial establishments", "para": "To enforce compliance, IMC is conducting a city-wide inspection drive. Property owners or operators found misusing basements or rooftops in violation of National Building Code (2016) Part-4 standards and prevailing building bylaws and safety standards will face formal